266
00:16:00,197 --> 00:16:03,286
So if you haven't subscribed yet, do it now,

267
00:16:03,306 --> 00:16:06,677
and tap the bell so you don't miss the next one.

268
00:16:06,747 --> 00:16:09,741
There are a lot more places hiding in these lakes,

269
00:16:09,761 --> 00:16:13,057
and I'd like you to be there when we find the next one.

270
00:16:13,127 --> 00:16:16,907
Thanks for watching.
